    "sl_custom_faq_r7Q6ht": {
      "type": "sl-custom-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_qjMHfp": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is red light therapy actually proven to work?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely! Red light therapy is backed by over 2,000 peer-reviewed clinical studies published in major medical journals. NASA originally developed it for wound healing in space. The FDA has cleared it for multiple conditions including acne, wrinkles, pain, and wound healing. This isn't pseudoscience - it's proven medical technology used in hospitals and clinics worldwide.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3UMHBR": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does red light therapy help with acne?",
            "answer": "<p>In many ways! We frequently use the combination red + blue light settings for our <a href=\"/pages/acne-bootcamp\" title=\"Acne Bootcamp\">Acne Bootcamp</a> Sessions because it calms histamine / hive-like reactions after performing extractions, and it speeds healing while also helping with active acne.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_PzXEKn": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How quickly will I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Results vary by condition and individual, but most clients notice initial improvements within 2-4 sessions. Anti-aging benefits like improved skin texture typically appear around week 3-4. Pain relief can be immediate for some, while others need 6-8 sessions. Maximum results usually occur after completing a full treatment series of 12-20 sessions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_GmWhMf": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it safe? Are there any side effects?",
            "answer": "<p>Red light therapy is one of the safest treatments available with zero reported side effects when used properly. It's non-invasive, painless, and requires no recovery time. The wavelengths we use don't contain harmful UV rays and won't damage your skin. It's safe for all skin types, pregnant women (though we recommend consulting your doctor), and can even be used daily.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_PGh67J": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How is this different from red light devices I can buy online?",
            "answer": "<p>Celluma delivers the correct dose of RLT; at-home devices run too high in J/cm², overwhelming the cell and causing water retention that lowers collagen; Celluma is low and slow, the right wavelength at the correct output over 30 min; most devices promise 5–10 min because they deliver energy too fiercely (think tortoise vs. hare).</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_XkqtLR": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does a treatment session feel like?",
            "answer": "<p>It's incredibly relaxing! You'll lie comfortably while the LED panel is positioned over your treatment area. You'll feel gentle warmth but no heat or discomfort. Many clients describe it as meditation-like and some even fall asleep. There's no pain, no downtime, and you can return to normal activities immediately. Each session lasts 30 minutes, and you can even apply makeup or skincare products right after.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_P6KPXe": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I combine red light therapy with other treatments?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Red light therapy actually enhances the results of many other treatments. It's excellent after facials that include extractions to reduce inflammation or following chemical peels to accelerate healing. Many clients add it to their regular facial or waxing appointments. We can also combine it with your existing skincare routine - the increased circulation helps products penetrate deeper for better results.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
